<title>GREECE: Greek/Bund gap widens to 366 bps, 274 vs BTP.</title>
<headline>Greek/Bund gap widens to 366 bps, 274 vs BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year bond over bunds rose to 366 basis points today from 362 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also widened to 274 basis points from 266 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.17%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.0%    04JUL07    5.51%	366	362 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.5%    25APR07    5.37%	380	375 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.43%	274	266 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.24%	293	287 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.16%	301	294 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.15%	202	201 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.33%	284	280 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 1244 GMT. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
